title: "Aykah: A Sustainable IoT-Powered Smart Waste Management System"

message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Almaktoum
    given-names: Nelly F.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-9887-0280"

repository-code: "https://github.com/nelmkt/Smart-Bin-Aykah"

abstract: >
  Aykah is a cost-effective smart waste management system that combines
  IoT sensing, real-time monitoring, an LCD interface, LED indicators,
  air filtration and solar-powered operation, supported by a community
  survey of 222 participants.

keywords:
  - Smart Waste Management
  - Internet of Things
  - Raspberry Pi
  - Solar Power
  - Sustainability
  - Smart Cities

